ame": "2024 HG screen 3.png", "id": "422911767473865", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974552_422911770807198_2018748843549627820_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XdHX1PZvOyoQ7kNvwFrdc2x&_nc_oc=AdlYyITP3fxQjHRCmWcxV-DZMHcMSJ20UZJJFxhE9NFuNAVwuFl5OEKefueY0xOlrzQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvbEfnQVG_L6qh1sSNZ2zZY4kBCcHaMA160ZKJ_XjnyOQ&oe=69A83728"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 4.png", "id": "1054432909633298", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974702_1054432912966631_7046083185660917993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xdXTpvGZYcQQ7kNvwF2rKsV&_nc_oc=Adk-z04mt4hZuoV9apw05cxnu1FeBcQeZGdoWmgHv2qYc96x93xlP38YGhU9DxrO3Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftcyYHGC6KV4RHH4gvAflIG1_kaGpdFcRX0NewbRLwX1g&oe=69A83FA2"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 1.png", "id": "527879776285288", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75557067_527879779618621_2727265542105493653_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7QdVJuWMbJ4Q7kNvwG5J8QX&_nc_oc=AdmIXsUEJlBhI3zAxIChxYsutZu2j2ifW7LgCKgDi35vQvpNKIzj8ez7uiNHZjvw8Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afu4ks6yhfBpHlOUHaEwZjj9cDkcY-U6vno4uArh-aWGnw&oe=69A822E1"}, {"file_name": "2024 HG screen 2.png", "id": "3704187989892735", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982651_3704187993226068_2653672913754187359_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fUErWScZkKsQ7kNvwHygl_T&_nc_oc=Admmm6cKVtp4P_KV6WiVXYX1SQGtz3aFh3DieeGseS7mjvUyf2UO-LUP8bxsxeUl420&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfvOYGNOpV7vBEZ_qaXUv6m5dlJitIwzY4Cre8ZSvDJrog&oe=69A83DFA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2024 HG Meta  Cover art.png", "id": "1870037076837448", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75451774_1870037080170781_4936049721755154926_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vs7zjbYzwcwQ7kNvwGX-zwv&_nc_oc=Adn_Bg9aic2bS6Meuk9SbWbLbYcsK2j69MwyQe0pWicIz1G55qfWkAO4pPBdMCMA-F0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuBlBRU36yNYVCGq26BDmK5OlxGPqYj7Mpjip3IbBkzaQ&oe=69A81B25"}, "display_name": "Harpagun", "keywords": ["Harpagun", "VR", "FPS", "Gun"], "long_description": "Be Harpagun. Get stranded on a deserted planet. Accidentally destroy your own rocket. Be swarmed by insane critters. Wreck stuff, throw aliens. Argue with your useless crew. Smash more enemies. Meet a girl. Have hallucinations. Listen to slav beats. Shoot living grenades.\n\nThis a game. In VR. With story and stuff. Also combat. A lot of combat. It\u2019s good - you have weapons but won\u2019t use them cause it\u2019s more fun to take a washing machine and slam it into an alien\u2019s head.\n\nYou can move stuff with a gravity ray. Enemies too, just yeet them into a wall or something and they die.\n\n\nIt\u2019s an arcade game. You know, one of the ones you actually have fun playing. Like an on-rails-shooter but not really because you can move around and don\u2019t puke. Just try it, it works. If not - return to sender, spend money on other stuff.", "short_description": "Harpagun is a fast-paced VR shooter where you smash alien critters, argue with your dysfunctional crew, and destroy everything in sight. Use weapons or everyday objects with a gravity ray to wreak havoc. Built for VR, it delivers chaotic fun, immersive combat, and a wild, hilarious storyline."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Something Random", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://somethingrandom.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_